    "text": "For the equilibrium $2 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{H}_{3} \\mathrm{O}^{+}+\\mathrm{OH}^{-} ;$ the value of $\\Delta \\mathrm{G}^{\\circ}$ at $298 \\mathrm{~K}$ is approximately:",
