  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\Delta G=\\Delta G^{\\circ}+R T \\ln Q$\r\n\r\nAt equilibrium; $\\Delta G=0$ and $Q=K_{\\mathrm{eq}}$\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow \\Delta G^{\\circ}=-2.303 \\mathrm{RT} \\log \\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{w}} \\\\\r\n\r\n=-2.303 \\times 8.314 \\times 298 \\times \\log 10^{-14}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n$=79.9 \\mathrm{~kJ} / \\mathrm{mol} \\approx 80 \\mathrm{~kJ} / \\mathrm{mol}$",
    "image": null
